From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:20:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] sapphire: fs1815: update to FourSemi v4.1.0-a with Xiaomi
 changes

Stock sapphire ships FourSemi driver v4.1.0-a. Import the public v4.1.0-a
core, keep the Qualcomm Kbuild glue, adapt i2c probe/remove to 5.15 and
re-add the Xiaomi changes recovered from the stock fs1815_dlkm.ko:
- chip id pre-check with 0x34 address fallback before reset
- g_probe_complete_flag / get_fsm_probe_complete_flag() for the
  dual-sourced amplifier arbitration with aw87xxx
- report "<dev>-FSM-" to lct_audio_info
- idempotent fsm_speaker_onn/off

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
